%% Mermaid flow: Approvals UX (staff)
flowchart TD
  A[Artifact READY] --> B{Reviewer opens review}
  B --> C[View diffs/QA]
  C --> D{Approve?}
  D -- Yes --> E[POST /reviews/{id}/approve]
  D -- No  --> F[POST /reviews/{id}/reject]
  E --> G[SSE: artifact_state APPROVED]
  E --> H[Portal: invalidate prior same-type links]
  F --> I[SSE: artifact_state REJECTED]
